# Track only files at the workspace root. Every subdirectory stays out of
# this repository: several of them (ARTEX/, artex-global/, communitytools/,
# pydantic-ai/, strix/) are their own git checkouts, and the others are
# reference trees that should not be versioned here.
/*/

# Keep root-level editor/OS junk out even though root files are tracked.
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
